<h2>Conclusion</h2>
<p>The Full-Text search combined with FILESTREAM and FileTable technologies=
 in SQL Server 2012 can be a very powerful tool for the business. Keeping v=
arious documents stored in a central location and performing blazingly fast=
 searches can improve the workflow for many people in the organization. Fur=
thermore, it is very easy to export files stored within different databases=
 and import them to FileTable storage in SQL Server, and thus making them a=
vailable to the file system and other applications. </p>
